    "%lld assigned · %lld on a trip" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已指派 %lld 列 · 運行中 %lld 列"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "割当 %lld 本 · 運行中 %lld 本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld units per game minute" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每遊戲分鐘 %lld 單位"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ゲーム内1分あたり %lld 単位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A ring cannot be reversed while one of its trains is running." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "環狀線有列車在跑時不能反轉站序，請等它跑完。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "環状線は列車の運行中に停車順を反転できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A managed company's city sets each station's ridership. Free play can change it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "經營模式下，各站的客源由城市決定；自由模式可以修改。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "経営モードでは各駅の利用者数を都市が決めます。フリープレイでは変更できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A minute later or earlier; the stops after it move with it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次加減一分鐘；之後的停靠站一起移動。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1分ずつ前後に動かします。以降の停車駅も一緒に動きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A minute longer or shorter, never shorter than the timetable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次加減一分鐘，不會短於整份時刻表。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1分ずつ長く・短くします。時刻表より短くはなりません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new stop comes 3 minutes after the last one and waits a minute; move its times with the steppers. Swipe a stop to remove it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新的停靠站排在上一站 3 分鐘後，停 1 分鐘；用加減按鈕調整時刻。向左滑可刪除停靠站。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新しい停車駅は前の駅の3分後に着き、1分停車します。時刻はステッパーで調整し、スワイプで削除できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A preset keeps the station's daily trips; they travel to the stations its lines reach." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "套用預設時，車站的每日人次不變；旅客會前往路線能到的車站。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "プリセットを使っても駅の1日の旅客数は変わりません。旅客は路線が通じる駅へ向かいます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A service starts at the first stop: put the train there and run it. An early train waits for its departure; a late one leaves once boarding is done." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "服務從第一站開始：把列車放在那裡再開始。早到的列車等到發車時刻；誤點的列車上下車完就開。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "運行は最初の停車駅から始まります：列車をそこに置いてから運行してください。早着の列車は発車時刻まで待ち、遅れた列車は乗降が終わり次第発車します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
