          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Build, then Network, to lay track, platforms and stations. With no tool, a tap on the map only looks." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "點「建設」再選「路網」，就能鋪軌道、設月台與車站。沒有選工具時，點地圖只是查看。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「建設」→「路線網」で線路、ホーム、駅を作れます。ツールを選ばずに地図をタップすると表示のみです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a station" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "選擇車站"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "駅を選択"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose what kind of place the station serves. A station without ridership starts no trips and draws none." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "選擇車站服務的地區類型。沒有客源的車站不會產生旅次，也不會吸引旅次。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "駅が担う地域の種類を選びます。利用者のない駅は旅客を生まず、引き寄せもしません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chooses how fast game time runs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
