    "No line links it to another station with ridership yet: the bars show how its own trips would spread over the day." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "還沒有路線連到其他有客源的車站：長條顯示它自己的旅次在一天中的分布。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "利用者のある他の駅へつながる路線がまだありません：棒は、この駅の旅客が1日にどう分布するかを示します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No lines yet. Pick stations under New Line to create one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "還沒有路線。在「新路線」選擇車站來建立。"
