    "Operating" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "營運"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "運行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Passenger Load" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "載客量"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "輸送量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Passenger load: the riders each stretch of track carries each way in the chosen hour, against what its trains can carry. A wider line has more riders, a darker blue a fuller train, and red is over capacity: add trains, run faster ones, or build a parallel line. Tap a stretch for the numbers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "載客量：選定時段每個區間每個方向載運的乘客，對照列車的運能。線越寬人越多，越深藍列車越滿，紅色表示超過運能：可以加車、開快一點的車，或蓋一條平行線。點一段軌道看數字。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "輸送量：選んだ時間帯に各区間が各方向に運ぶ乗客数と、列車の輸送力の比較です。線が太いほど乗客が多く、青が濃いほど列車が混雑、赤は輸送力超過です：列車を増やす、速い列車を走らせる、並行路線を造るなどしてください。区間をタップすると数値を表示します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Passengers" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "乘客"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "乗客"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Passengers pay as they board. Running and upkeep are settled every hour, energy and staff every day, and the balance may go below zero." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "乘客上車時付費。營運與維護每小時結算，能源與員工每日結算，餘額可能變成負數。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "乗客は乗車時に支払います。運行費と保守費は毎時、エネルギーと人件費は毎日精算され、残高はマイナスになることもあります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paste %@" : {
