    },
    "The Taiwan Railway’s Yilan Line from Toucheng to Su’aoxin, built on its real alignment with a weekday’s real trains running" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "台鐵宜蘭線頭城到蘇澳新，照真實路線蓋好，平日的真實班次已經在跑"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "台湾鉄道宜蘭線の頭城〜蘇澳新を実際の線形どおりに建設し、平日の実際の列車が運行中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Railways already built and running: Taiwan’s real lines, or a simple one to try things on" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已經蓋好、正在營運的路網：台灣的真實路線，或拿來試功能的簡單地圖"
          }
