    "Switches take time to throw" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "道岔扳轉要時間"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "分岐器の転換に時間がかかる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With traffic control on, a train waits 4 seconds before it moves when a switch on its route has to be thrown the other way." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "交通控制開啟時，進路上的道岔要扳到另一邊，列車要等 4 秒才開動。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "運行管理がオンのとき、進路上の分岐器を反対側へ転換する必要があると、列車は4秒待ってから動き出します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, a train takes its whole route before it leaves, and other trains wait until it has cleared it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟時，列車出發前會預約整條進路，其他列車要等它讓出進路。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オンのとき、列車は発車前に進路全体を確保し、他の列車はその進路が空くまで待ちます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With network routes, passengers change lines and walk to stations nearby; otherwise they ride only a line serving both stations." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟後，乘客會轉乘其他路線，也會步行到附近的車站；關閉時只搭兩站都停靠的路線。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "乗り換え経路がオンだと、乗客は路線を乗り換えたり近くの駅へ歩いたりします。オフだと両駅に停まる路線にのみ乗ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
